<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trīclīnĭāris</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		triclinium, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to an eating -
				couch</i> or <i>diningroom.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gradus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 8, § 32</span></i>
			 Müll.: apothecae, id. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Non. 545, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mappae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. L. L. 9, § 47</span></i>
			 Müll.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lecti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 2, 6, § 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestimenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					33, 5, 20</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trīclīnĭārĭa</span></b> ,
				ĭum, n.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>An eating-room</i>, <i>dining-room</i>, <i>supper-room</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 1, 13, 7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Tapestry</i> or <i>covering for
				table-couches</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 48, 74, § 196</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">9, 39, 63, §
				137</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
